---
<section id="inicio" class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center">
      <span class="inline-block py-1 px-4 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6">Consultor & Estratega Digital</span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-8">
        Roberto Pérez <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600">Salazar</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        Transformo ideas en negocios escalables. Especialista en adquisición de clientes y optimización de conversiones para marcas personales y corporativas.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#proyectos" class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 text-white text-lg font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center">
          Ver Proyectos Destacados
        </a>
        <a href="#sobre-mi" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-slate-900 text-lg font-bold rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex items-center justify-center">
          Conoce mi Historia
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Decorative elements -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-full -z-0 opacity-20">
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] rounded-full bg-blue-400 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] rounded-full bg-indigo-400 blur-[120px]"></div>
  </div>
</section>
